su name see from filename input ob text prompter as text mind to name text output be ceremony def
  ob text of ob of this to name text prompter be text do
  ob filename of from of this to name text image path be text do
  ob text of as of this to name text mind be text do
  exists su name cmd ob text "node command/see_vl_runner.mjs --prompt-stdin" be text ya
  ob text " --image \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name image path to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name ollama host to name text host be text do
  ob text " --host \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name host to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob text " --model \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name mind to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob text of cmd fromtext text of prompter to name text output be command do
  su name output ret
prah

